OL,3,GNEWSASafety wristbands given to female
OL,4,Arunners
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 safety wristbands have
OL,7,Fbeen given to women in running groups
OL,8,Fin north Devon, funded by money seized
OL,9,Fby police from criminal activities.
OL,11,FThe wristbands feature a personal alarm
OL,12,Fdesigned to attract attention in an
OL,13,Femergency.
OL,15,FIlfracombe Running Club applied for
OL,16,Ffunding for the devices, with leaders
OL,17,Fsaying it was partly because of the
OL,18,Fdistrict being "remote... and a lot of
OL,19,Fvulnerable ladies running on their own
OL,20,Fat night."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
