OL,3,GNEWSASafety wristbands given to female
OL,4,Arunners
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Joey Lester, of Devon and Cornwall
OL,7,FPolice, said: "Sadly, being a female
OL,8,Fyou do fear crime and being attacked.
OL,9,FThe reality is we have very low
OL,10,Fstranger attacks on lone females but
OL,11,Fthat doesn't make it any less important
OL,12,Fbecause one victim is one too many."
